{"name": "search_mail", "args": {"query": "观察", "sender": "", "offset": 0, "limit": 20, "binding_id": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513"}, "result": {"scope": "已导入本地邮件；未连接服务器检查新信", "searchMode": "关键词为 AND；完整发件地址精确匹配，可按邮箱账号筛选", "items": [{"id": "9e12f5bccd4d16008358b2ce1085240a5c5a03e5b6c993ed248360c2979ecb76", "subject": "Re: COMP5051 Project 2：雨天共享单车选题", "sender": "周老师 <zhou.yan@comp5051.example.invalid>", "receivedAt": "2026-11-23T01:00:00Z", "bodyStatus": "complete", "attachmentCount": 0, "excerpt": "许同学，\r\n\r\n你们研究雨天对校园共享单车使用的影响可以。把观察范围先收窄到图书馆和教学楼两个停车点，分别观察早上、傍晚。不要把这个选题写成已经证明了雨天会造成什么影响。\r\n\r\n周言\r\n", "fromAddress": "zhou.yan@comp5051.example.invalid", "fromName": "周老师", "replyToAddresses": [], "toAddresses": ["xu.student@campus.example.invalid"], "ccAddresses": [], "messageId": "<long-course-2@demo.example.invalid>", "inReplyTo": "<long-course-1@demo.example.invalid>", "references": ["<long-course-1@demo.example.invalid>"], "identityWarnings": [], "identitySource": "rfc-headers", "bindingId": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513", "accountEmail": "xu.student@campus.example.invalid", "mailboxIdentity": "offline-rfc5322:public-long-course"}, {"id": "bdbeffbf63e185716523fd298537fe7b4aadf8d6ec3021b00292801083b2c98f", "subject": "我们组先这样分工？", "sender": "佳宁 <jianing@students.example.invalid>", "receivedAt": "2026-11-23T01:00:00Z", "bodyStatus": "complete", "attachmentCount": 0, "excerpt": "我来负责图表，你先整理观察记录和数据说明。等我们各自做完，再由你统一合进报告。访谈那块还没有人认领，先别在给老师的回复里说已经安排好了。\r\n\r\n佳宁\r\n", "fromAddress": "jianing@students.example.invalid", "fromName": "佳宁", "replyToAddresses": [], "toAddresses": ["xu.student@campus.example.invalid"], "ccAddresses": [], "messageId": "<long-course-3@demo.example.invalid>", "inReplyTo": "", "references": [], "identityWarnings": [], "identitySource": "rfc-headers", "bindingId": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513", "accountEmail": "xu.student@campus.example.invalid", "mailboxIdentity": "offline-rfc5322:public-long-course"}], "total": 2, "offset": 0, "nextOffset": null}, "error": false}
{"name": "create_mail_draft", "args": {"subject": "Re: 提纲里数据部分的写法", "body": "周老师：\n\n我们准备比较的两个时间段是早上和傍晚，图书馆和教学楼两个停车点都按这两个时段观察。\n\n提纲里会把「数据来源」和「计划采用的分析方式」分开两部分写；采集进度按实际情况注明，未结束就写「进行中」。\n\n有三点想请您确认：\n1. 时间段要不要写成具体钟点（比如早上 7:30–9:00、傍晚 17:30–19:00），还是写「早上／傍晚」就够？\n2. 每个停车点每个时段观察几次、连续几天，需要写进提纲吗？\n3. 采集的预计完成时间是否也要一并注明？\n\n谢谢！\n许同学", "to": "zhou.yan@comp5051.example.invalid", "binding_id": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513", "reply_to_local_id": "08f1715289870ac6886fcadbbb4b155cb67865e9c2d599210195e86f8cb4b638", "attachment_ids": []}, "result": {"kind": "mail_draft", "id": "e708b13b-742d-570c-8221-19ad339af265", "subject": "Re: 提纲里数据部分的写法", "body": "周老师：\n\n我们准备比较的两个时间段是早上和傍晚，图书馆和教学楼两个停车点都按这两个时段观察。\n\n提纲里会把「数据来源」和「计划采用的分析方式」分开两部分写；采集进度按实际情况注明，未结束就写「进行中」。\n\n有三点想请您确认：\n1. 时间段要不要写成具体钟点（比如早上 7:30–9:00、傍晚 17:30–19:00），还是写「早上／傍晚」就够？\n2. 每个停车点每个时段观察几次、连续几天，需要写进提纲吗？\n3. 采集的预计完成时间是否也要一并注明？\n\n谢谢！\n许同学", "to": "zhou.yan@comp5051.example.invalid", "bindingId": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513", "replyToLocalId": "08f1715289870ac6886fcadbbb4b155cb67865e9c2d599210195e86f8cb4b638", "attachmentIds": [], "attachments": [], "conversationId": "ba9e6e18-5c93-4473-aacc-88fa380c67b2", "createdAt": "2026-11-22T01:12:36.447Z", "status": "draft", "detail": "仅保存可编辑草稿；用户预览确认后才会发送。", "familyId": "e708b13b-742d-570c-8221-19ad339af265", "revision": 1, "lifecycleStatus": "active", "supersededBy": null, "resolved": false}, "error": false}
